  "limitations": [
    "All228 final portraits were actually reviewed as labelled 288x360 contact cards by two reviewers; only the nine listed final outputs were additionally viewed at native384x480.",
    "The 36 lifetime and60 adult wardrobe overview sheets contain six overlapping adult everyday portraits; they represent90 distinct combinations, not96.",
    "The additional48x60 overview is a small-size legibility check. Iris detail and subtle facial distinctions are necessarily limited at that size.",
    "Raw source anatomy review, image hashes, and byte-preservation checks are separate evidence. None substitutes for user acceptance.",
    "Historical uniform accuracy and runtime integration were outside this visual review.",
